{"question": "Nghiên cứu về điều trị lichen phẳng niêm mạc miệng bằng huyết tương giàu tiểu cầu (PRP) so với corticosteroid tiêm có ghi nhận tác dụng phụ nào không?", "claim": "Nghiên cứu so sánh huyết tương giàu tiểu cầu và corticosteroid tiêm trong điều trị lichen phẳng niêm mạc miệng ghi nhận không có tác dụng phụ nào ở nhóm thử nghiệm.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu ghi nhận kết quả điều trị lichen phẳng niêm mạc miệng bằng PRP (Plasma Rich in Growth Factors) không xuất hiện tác dụng phụ."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "In the study by Una El Shinnawi and Bassant Mowafey, ten patients with a histopathological diagnosis of oral erosive lichen planus (seven females and three males), aged between 50 and 65 years, were included. These patients were resistant to conventional treatment. Each patient received an injection of 0.5 ml of autologous PRP per 1 cm² of ulcerated mucosa using a 25-gauge needle, administered once weekly for 4 weeks.[33]"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q2", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Table 1"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q3", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Characteristics of included randomized controlled trials comparing platelet-rich plasma and injectable steroids in oral lichen planus."}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q4", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "First author, year | Study design | Country | Female/Male | Mean age | Sample size | OLP type | Intervention | Evaluation methods (VAS) | Follow up Period | Outcome | Adverse effect"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q5", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Experiment group | Control group | Experiment group | Control group"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q6", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Laura Piñasa et al. 2017 | RCT | Spain | 10/0 | 48±12 | 10 | 10 | Atrophic Erosive | Plasma Rich in Growth Factors PRGF/PRP | Corticosteroid | Histopathological | 13±1 month | 1 Infiltration Of PRP In eight Patients and two infiltrations required two patients patients’ complete response | No Side Effects"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Comparison of platelet rich plasma and injectable steroids in the treatment of oral lichen planus: A systematic review and meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "RESULTS", "Characteristics of the studies"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Comparison of platelet rich plasma and injectable steroids in the treatment of oral lichen planus: A systematic review and meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "RESULTS", "Characteristics of the studies"]}]}
