{"question": "Nhiễm sắc thể 21 (HSA21) chiếm khoảng bao nhiêu phần trăm của bộ gen người và liên quan đến những hội chứng bạch cầu nào?", "claim": "Nhiễm sắc thể 21 (HSA21) chiếm khoảng 1%-1.5% bộ gen người, và sự mất cân bằng của nó làm tăng nguy cơ mắc bệnh bạch cầu cấp dòng lympho B (liên quan đến CRLF2) cũng như bệnh bạch cầu cấp dòng mẫu tiểu cầu.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu y khoa ghi nhận HSA21 chiếm 1-1.5% bộ gen người, thể tam nhiễm liên quan đến tăng nguy cơ bạch cầu cấp dòng lympho B do đột biến CRLF2 và bạch cầu cấp dòng mẫu tiểu cầu do quá biểu hiện RUNX1 và ERG."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Table 1"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q2", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Baseline characteristics of included studies"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q3", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Study (Year) | Country | Design | Sample size(I/C) | Population | Age(Mean ± SD or Range) | Male(%) | Baseline Plaque Index(Mean ± SD) | Baseline Gingivitis Index(Mean ± SD) | Follow-up(Months)"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q4", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Khan et al. (2022) [28] | India | Parallel RCT | 56 (28/28) | Adults with moderate gingivitis | 21.46 ± 3.78 | Not reported | Plaque Index: M: 9.723 ± 8.697 P: 21.896 ± 17.118 | Gingival Index: M: 0.0724 ± 0.086 P: 0.084 ± 0.045 | 1.5"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q5", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "The human chromosome 21 (HSA21) represents about 1%–1.5% of the human genome. While it is one of the smallest chromosomes, it remains one of the most extensively studied (Figure 1) (7, 14). Although considered to have a relatively low gene content, its imbalance is associated with multiple clinical phenotypes and pathologies, as observed in HSA21 trisomy (14). The trisomy is accompanied by an increased risk of developing Acute B-lymphoblastic leukaemia, which is often linked to mutations or rearrangements of Cytokine Receptor Like Factor 2 (CRLF2) or genes encoding other lymphocyte differentiation factors. Similarly, the increased risk of developing Acute megakaryoblastic leukaemia has been related to the over-expression of the RUNX1 and ETS-related gene (ERG), while transient myeloproliferative disorder is frequently associated with somatic truncating mutations in the GATA-binding facto"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q6", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "r 1 (GATA1) transcription factor gene (7, 15). Additionally, numerous inflammation-related genes are located on HSA21, including S100 calcium-binding protein B (S100B), Ig-Like Cell Adhesion Molecule (CXADR), a disintegrin and metalloproteinase with thrombospondin motifs 5 (ADAMTS5), super oxide dismutase 1 (SOD1), Interferon Alpha And Beta Receptor"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Comparative efficacy of electric toothbrush technologies in plaque and gingivitis reduction: a network meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Study selection and characteristics"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Periodontitis and Alzheimer's disease, common pathways in down syndrome", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Genes over-expression associated with chromosome 21-trisomy"]}]}
