riapical abscess", "Heterogeneity of studies"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Prevalence and Risk of Dental Erosion Linked to Carbonated Drinks in Adolescents: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "RESULTS", "Qualitative Analysis"]}]}
