eks) | PI: 1.96 (8 weeks) | PBI: 0.29 (8 weeks) | PBI: 0.63 (8 weeks) | API: no difference"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Treating Stage IV periodontitis: the UK adolopment of the EFP Stage IV Periodontitis Treatment Guidelines", "heading_path": ["Body", "Long-term outcomes of treatment in Stage IV periodontitis patients"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Comparative efficacy of electric toothbrush technologies in plaque and gingivitis reduction: a network meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Results of the network meta-analysis"]}]}
